&lt;td style="vertical-align:bottom;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="bottom"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:12pt;"&gt;業務を執行した公認会計士の氏名&lt;/p&gt;
